  "narrative": {
    "intro": "BP Products North America has $413M in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date across 22 awards, with an average award size of $18.8M. BP Products North America obligations are up 566.6% year over year. The current-year totals are partial and represent fiscal year to date activity. Historical context shows BP Products North America obligations peaked at $1.6B in FY22 and declined in subsequent years to $62M in FY25 before the FY26 rebound to $413M. The page reports obligations rather than award-value totals except where noted for largest awards and expiring-contracts tables, and the counts and averages reflect awarded obligations for the current fiscal period. This summary is focused on contract obligations and award counts, not on unit prices, product descriptions, or buyer lists, which are not provided in the figures.",
